  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "影視劇本實作",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICAL COURSE： SCREENPLAY WRITING",
    "describe_ch": "劇本為一劇之本，是影視拍攝的基礎，如何透過編劇專業，讓劇本發揮最大效能，唯有透過書寫實作，鍛鍊心法與技法。本課程由故事大綱、人物小傳、分場、劇本按部就班實作，分組於期末完成一部短片劇本，並以讀劇會發表。",
    "describe_eh": "The script is the foundation of a drama, and it is the basis of film and television shooting. How to use the screenwriting profession to maximize the effectiveness of the script can only be practiced through writing and practicing. This course consists of a story outline, character biographies, breakouts, and scripts step by step. Groups will complete a short film script at the end of the semester, and will publish it in a drama reading session.",
